---
---
<section class="bg-black py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-14">
    <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-4">You're not alone in asking this</span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
      Every Parent of a Teenager<br>Is Carrying These <em class="italic text-[#FFD100]">Quiet Fears</em>
    </h2>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/5 mb-10">
    {[
      {
        q: 'Will my child be financially independent or financially stuck long after they should be?',
        p: 'The thought of supporting them into their 30s isn\'t just financial pressure. It\'s a signal that something was never built.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Will they honour God with their money or chase the world\'s version of success?',
        p: 'Faith and finance are not separate. But nobody is teaching young people how to hold them together.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Will they fall for debt, get-rich-quick traps, and dangerous financial shortcuts?',
        p: 'In an age of crypto scams, peer pressure, and social media lifestyle inflation, the traps are everywhere and they\'re getting smarter.',
      },
      {
        q: 'How do I teach them what I was never taught myself?',
        p: 'Most parents are trying to pass on wisdom they had to build from scratch often painfully. There\'s a better way.',
      },
    ].map((fear) => (
      <div class="bg-[#111111] p-8 border-l-4 border-l-white/5 hover:border-l-[#FFD100] transition-colors">
        <p class="text-xl italic text-white font-light leading-relaxed mb-3">{fear.q}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/40 leading-relaxed">{fear.p}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto border border-white/10 border-t-2 border-t-[#FFD100] p-8 text-center">
    <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-4">The answer is not more worry</span>
    <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-3">It's <strong class="text-white">one conversation, structured well.</strong> This free webinar gives you the framework, the language, and the biblical foundation to have it with confidence and clarity.</p>
    <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">You don't need to have all the answers. You just need to take the first step.</p>
  </div>
</section>
